OL,3,GNEWSATaxi firm calls out customers over
OL,4,Aracist remarks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA taxi firm has condemned "frequent"
OL,7,Fracist remarks directed by some
OL,8,Fcustomers at the company's taxi
OL,9,Fdrivers.
OL,11,FIn a post on social media,
OL,12,FBlaydon-based Local Taxis criticised
OL,13,Fthe use of "unacceptable" racial slurs
OL,14,Fand requests by customers not to be
OL,15,Fassigned Asian drivers.
OL,17,FDispatcher Sam Reid told BBC Radio
OL,18,FNewcastle she often worried about the
OL,19,Fsafety of her colleagues.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,397,390,260,160,0,100
