OL,3,GNEWSATaxi firm calls out customers over
OL,4,Aracist remarks
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It happens far more than anyone would
OL,7,Flike to imagine. It's not
OL,8,Fonce-in-a-blue-moon. This is something
OL,9,Fthat we find more than once a day, and
OL,10,Fthe frequency is far too high, it's
OL,11,Fjust not acceptable."
